{"id":"ff3393113d3c8fe1","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-thm-suslin.md","title":"Souslin's Borel Characterization","display":"thm-suslin — Souslin's Borel Characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-suslin","aliases":["58-thm-suslin","Souslin theorem"],"display":"thm-suslin — Souslin's Borel Characterization","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-analytic.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-reals.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-suslin"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-suslin</span><span>Souslin theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-suslin — Souslin's Borel Characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eee1caaab6856e0d\" href=\"?note=eee1caaab6856e0d\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-analytic.md\">../batch08/58-df-analytic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c54af6fc6a780954\" href=\"?note=c54af6fc6a780954\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-reals.md\">../batch02/58-df-reals.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\)</span> (set of reals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> (the Euclidean topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Analytic}\">\\(\\mathrm{Analytic}\\)</span> (analytic-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"eee1caaab6856e0d\" href=\"?note=eee1caaab6856e0d\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-analytic.md\">../batch08/58-df-analytic.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}\\)</span> (Borel-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}suslin}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Borel}(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Analytic}(A)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Analytic}(\\mathbb R\\setminus A)\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}suslin}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Borel}(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Analytic}(A)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Analytic}(\\mathbb R\\setminus A)\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Equivalently, the Borel subsets of a Polish space are exactly the sets that are both analytic and coanalytic.</li>\n<li>Writing “<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Borel}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Borel}\\)</span>” without an ambient topology does not match the repository's Borel predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-analytic.md","status":"resolved","id":"eee1caaab6856e0d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-analytic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-reals.md","status":"resolved","id":"c54af6fc6a780954","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-reals.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-analytic.md","status":"resolved","id":"eee1caaab6856e0d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Analytic}$ (analytic-set predicate, see [[../batch08/58-df-analytic.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Borel}$ (Borel-set predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Analytic}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Borel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}suslin}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Borel}(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Analytic}(A)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Analytic}(\\mathbb R\\setminus A)\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Borel}","display":false}],"bytes":1110,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4455","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-thm-suslin.md|58-thm-suslin]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["eee1caaab6856e0d","9375de7089953a2b","c54af6fc6a780954"]}